  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Documented deployment",
      "items": [
        "Production overlay sets an HPA minimum of three API replicas and TLS ingress",
        "Helm production values enable HPA 3–10, PDB, and a scoped network policy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Dependency boundary",
      "items": [
        "Production overlay enables bundled Redis Sentinel HA; PostgreSQL and Keycloak remain external",
        "The API-to-PostgreSQL edge is an optional adapter path, not active reference-host wiring or proof of hybrid EF Core registration",
        "The Helm production overlay does not bundle the OTel collector; its standalone manifest supplies the production export path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Evidence boundary",
      "items": [
        "The production OTel collector manifest exports traces and metrics to the SIEM OTLP gateway; the Helm production overlay does not bundle the collector, and local compose targets are not the production endpoint",
        "Manifests and workflow files are repository evidence, not live-cluster proof"
      ]
    }
